{
  "about": "A module's parts in the shared layout, one key per part (doc shape 3; web packages/ydoc moduleMembers.ts, desktop src/sync/ModuleMembers.cpp; docs/module-members.md). `keys`: the sidecarItems key of a part in a module. `badKeys`: p: keys no writer makes (both apps skip them, the server refuses them). `values`: what a key may hold. `read`: a module's starting list (`members`, absent when the module's value has none) and its keys (part id to value) with the parts it reads as. `write`: the same, the parts wanted, and the keys a writer sets (in order) and deletes. `docs`: a layout (`base`, a Yjs update v1 in base64) with five parts (`parts`) and a module (`moduleId`) of the first two, written before the keys; `concurrent`: an update the web made on it (`web`), the edit the desktop makes at the same time (`desktop`) and every module's name and sorted parts after both (`expect`); `keyed`: the layout after the web added part 2 and took part 0 out, what it reads as (`keyedExpect`) and its part keys (`keyedKeys`), and the part keys after either app then adds part 3 and takes part 1 out (`keyedThenKeys`).",
